#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:13
msgid "Aims"
msgstr "目的"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:17
msgid ""
"This Masterclass aims to introduce users to the tools available via PLUMED "
"to analyze and perform simulations of concentration-driven processes such as"
" nucleation, growth, and diffusion."
msgstr ""

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:21
msgid "Objectives"
msgstr "到達目標"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:25
msgid "Once this Masterclass is completed, users will be able to:"
msgstr "この Masterclass を終えると、次のことができるようになる。"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:29
msgid "Write a PLUMED input file to analyze a trajectory with multicolvars."
msgstr ""

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:31
msgid ""
"Use the Depth-First-Search tools available in PLUMED to characterize "
"clusters of atoms in an existing vapour condensation trajectory."
msgstr ""

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:33
msgid ""
"Write a PLUMED input file to analyze the condensation of a simple liquid "
"phase from vapour."
msgstr ""

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:35
msgid ""
"Write a PLUMED input file for CmuMD, and perform a CmuMD simulation of "
"liquid condensation at constant driving force."
msgstr ""

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:37
msgid ""
"Write a PLUMED input file for CmuMD, and perform a CmuMD simulation to model"
" steady-state diffusive flux across a simulation box."
msgstr ""

